{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日はB.L.T.さんのソログラビア撮影がありました♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"先月、乃木坂46みんなで\n浴衣をきて載せてもらってから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今回もこうやって撮影して頂けて\nとてもうれしいです！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"真夏の太陽が照りつける中の撮影で\n夏の終わりというテーマがあって"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"不等号のMVでもお世話になった\nあのアイテムと撮影したよ！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"発売は8月24日です！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"よろしくお願いします！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あ！そうそう！\n皆さんは冷たい飲み物を飲む時、\n氷をいれて飲む派？\n飲み物を冷やして氷入れないで飲む派？"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/5221447/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ヤングガンガンさんのオフショット！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/5221447/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"耳がオレンジになっちゃった！！！の図"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/5221447/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"急にオフになった時に\n何をするのかいまのうちに決めておきなっ！\nって今日のメイクさんに\n言われてから今日一日\nなにをしたいか考えてる！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"なにをしたいー？って聞かれても\n特になにも思いつかない。。。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"浴衣をきて花火大会行きたいけど\n夜でもこの暑さだと気が引けるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"テーマパークに夜からいこう！って\nなっても暑いし、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも家でダラダラするのももったいない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かき氷食べに行きたいけど\n行くまでがあついし～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うーん、、、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"暑いの苦手だな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/5221447/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、それぞれの季節にいいところがあるから\n夏が嫌いなわけじゃない！！！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"寒すぎる冬も嫌いじゃないし\n乾燥しすぎてる秋も嫌いじゃないし\n眠すぎる春も嫌いじゃない！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いろいろなものに\n良いところと悪いところ\n好きなところと嫌いなところがあって\nでもどれもそれはそのものの一部だから"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"この部分のこれは好きだからいるけど\nこの部分は好きじゃないからいらない。って\nできないですね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"全てを受け止められる\n理解できる努力をしなくちゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"だから、ごめんね。夏。\n暑いけど好きだよ。夏。\nうなぎとすいかとかき氷が美味しいのは\n夏だもんね。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたもよろしくね、夏。"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"あしたも撮影！がんばります！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"いまね\n心の機能が全開で100パーセントあるとしたら\n40パーセントくらいしか機能してない。。、"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ぎゅーーーってなってる( ˘ｰωｰ˘ )"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"がんばらないと～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ツアーもあるし神宮もあるし\n他にもいろいろたくさんことを\nさせてもらってるし"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"柔軟性と吸収性と忍耐性をつけなきゃ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/5221447/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/5221447/0003.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"最近は\n秋に向けて\n部屋着を揃えようと思ってます！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"もこもこがかわいい！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"肌触りがいいやつ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"かわいいよね！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/08/09/5221447/0002.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"それでは、きょうはこのへんで！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"おやすみなさい！"}],"source":"archive"}